*  each starting point.                                              *
*                                                                    *
*  Kind of trajectory: 1 = 3 dimensional                             *
*                      2 = on model layers                           *
*                      3 = mixing layer                              *
*                      4 = isobaric                                  *
*                      5 = isentropic                                *
*                                                                    *
**********************************************************************
