*  Unit of z coordinate: 1 = Meters above sea level                  *
*                        2 = Meters above ground                     *
*                        3 = Hectopascal                             *
*                                                                    *
*  For mixing layer trajectories (kind 3), the z coordinate must be  *
*  given in m.a.g.l. (option 2)                                      *
*                                                                    *
